alse ml-1">Departure</p></button></li></ul><div class="loader"></div><div class="container_container__NQ5De "><div class="w-full"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 md:mb-4"><h2 class="text-marine01 header3 ">Carefree start</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 lg:gap-3 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="relative"><div class="relative mb-[90px] md:mb-[96px] aspect-square md:aspect-[3/4] lg:aspect-square "><div class="w-full h-full"></div></div><div class="rounded bg-white shadow-small rounded-tl-none hover:shadow-mediumHovered border border-blue08 transition absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[calc(100%_-_16px)]  p-2 md:p-2"><h3 class="text-marine01 break-words line-clamp-2 md:h-[3.5rem] lg:h-[4rem] lg:h-[3.5rem] header5 mb-1.5"> Travel well prepared</h3><p class="small text-marine01 line-clamp-4 lg:line-clamp-3 text-marine02 small">Read more about the ideal preparation of your departure or arrival at Eindhoven Airport.</p><a target="_self" class="button_btn-tertiary__tPetw text-blue03 mt-2" aria-label="See more about well prepared traveling" href="/en/travel-well-prepared"><span class="text-marine01 header6">More info</span><svg width="24" height="24" fill="#202834" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Right" class=" ml-1.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7.97 4.47a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l7 7a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7 7a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L14.44 12 7.97 5.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06Z"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="relative mb-[90px] md:mb-[96px] aspect-square md:aspect-[3/4] lg:aspect-square "><div class="w-full h-full"></div></div><div class="rounded bg-white shadow-small rounded-tl-none hover:shadow-mediumHovered border border-blue08 transition absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[calc(100%_-_16px)]  p-2 md:p-2"><h3 class="text-marine01 break-words line-clamp-2 md:h-[3.5rem] lg:h-[4rem] lg:h-[3.5rem] header5 mb-1.5">Liquids</h3><p class="small text-marine01 line-clamp-4 lg:line-clamp-3 text-marine02 small">Carrying liquids in your hand luggage is subject to a number of specific rules.</p><a target="_self" class="button_btn-tertiary__tPetw text-blue03 mt-2" aria-label="See more about liquids" href="/en/en/everything-about-liquids-your-hand-luggage"><span class="text-marine01 header6">More info</span><svg width="24" height="24" fill="#202834" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Right" class=" ml-1.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7.97 4.47a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l7 7a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7 7a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L14.44 12 7.97 5.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06Z"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="relative mb-[90px] md:mb-[96px] aspect-square md:aspect-[3/4] lg:aspect-square "><div class="w-full h-full"></div></div><div class="rounded bg-white shadow-small rounded-tl-none hover:shadow-mediumHovered border border-blue08 transition absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[calc(100%_-_16px)]  p-2 md:p-2"><h3 class="text-marine01 break-words line-clamp-2 md:h-[3.5rem] lg:h-[4rem] lg:h-[3.5rem] header5 mb-1.5">Construction work</h3><p class="small text-marine01 line-clamp-4 lg:line-clamp-3 text-marine02 small">During the expansion of our terminal, we make sure you can continue to travel comfortably.</p><a target="_blank" class="button_btn-tertiary__tPetw text-blue03 mt-2" aria-label="What to expect?" href="/en/construction-work-passengers"><span class="text-marine01 header6">More info</span><svg width="24" height="24" fill="#202834" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Right" class=" ml-1.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7.97 4.47a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l7 7a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7 7a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L14.44 12 7.97 5.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06Z"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="relative mb-[90px] md:mb-[96px] aspect-square md:aspect-[3/4] lg:aspect-square "><div class="w-full h-full"></div></div><div class="rounded bg-white shadow-small rounded-tl-none hover:shadow-mediumHovered border border-blue08 transition absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[calc(100%_-_16px)]  p-2 md:p-2"><h3 class="text-marine01 break-words line-clamp-2 md:h-[3.5rem] lg:h-[4rem] lg:h-[3.5rem] header5 mb-1.5">Passport control</h3><p class="small text-marine01 line-clamp-4 lg:line-clamp-3 text-marine02 small">Please be aware that there may be queues at passport control.</p><a target="_self" class="button_btn-tertiary__tPetw text-blue03 mt-2" aria-label="Read more about passport control" href="/en/entry-exit-system"><span class="text-marine01 header6">Read more</span><svg width="24" height="24" fill="#202834" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Right" class=" ml-1.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7.97 4.47a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l7 7a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7 7a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L14.44 12 7.97 5.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06Z"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="container_container__NQ5De "><div class="w-full"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 md:mb-4"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 lg:gap-3 md:grid-cols-1 full-card"><div class="rounded bg-white shadow-small group hover:shadow-mediumHovered transition  cursor-pointer"><a class="block h-full" aria-label="Read more about assistance" href="/en/assistance"><div class="min-h-full relative bg-cover bg-center transition p-2 md:p-3 lg:flex false border rounded border-blue02 bg-blue03 group-hover:bg-blue01 "><div class=" lg:w-[60px] lg:mr-2.5 lg:mb-0 mb-1.5 mb-2"><svg width="60" height="60" fill="#202834" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" name="wheelchair" class="mr-1.5 fill-white" viewBox="-3 0 30 25"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.476 5.737a3.33 3.33 0 0 0 1.804.523 3.307 3.307 0 0 0 2.29-.922 3.077 3.077 0 0 0 .946-2.211c0-.62-.192-1.224-.549-1.739A3.222 3.222 0 0 0 13.51.237 3.354 3.354 0 0 0 11.634.06c-.63.122-1.207.421-1.66.86a3.097 3.097 0 0 0-.885 1.605 3.028 3