 eat at the airport</h2><p class="mb-3 text-marine02">Whether you're in the mood for a quick bite before your flight, a cup of coffee while you wait, or want to enjoy a full meal, the airport has something for everyone.</p><div class="mt-3"><a target="_self" class="button_btn-primary-blue__uyvGQ undefined !px-3" aria-label="Explore our dining &amp; retail options" href="/en/food-drinks"><span class="text-marine01 header6">See here</span><svg width="24" height="24" fill="#202834" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Right" class=" ml-1.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7.97 4.47a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l7 7a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7 7a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L14.44 12 7.97 5.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06Z"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="container_container__NQ5De relative md:min-h-[520px] md:pb-9 "><div class="relative aspect-video z-[-1] -mx-2 md:mx-0 visual-block_visual-block__media-container--full-width__BP4wY"><div class="w-full h-full"></div></div><div class="rounded bg-white shadow-big -mt-4 md:absolute bottom-0 px-2 py-3 md:p-4 md:w-2/3 lg:w-1/2 bg-white z-10 border border-blue08 overflow-visible right-2 md:right-3 lg:right:2"><h2 class="text-marine01 header2 mb-1.5">Get inspired </h2><p class="mb-3 text-marine02">Fly to more than 80 destinations from Eindhoven Airport</p><div class="mt-3"><a target="_self" class="button_btn-primary-blue__uyvGQ undefined !px-3" aria-label="Find your next destination" href="/en/destinations"><span class="text-marine01 header6">More information</span><svg width="24" height="24" fill="#202834" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Right" class=" ml-1.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7.97 4.47a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0l7 7a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7 7a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L14.44 12 7.97 5.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06Z"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="container_container__NQ5De flex flex-col items-center"><h2 class="text-marine01 mb-3 md:mb-4 text-center header4">Stay informed, receive the monthly newsletter!</h2><div class="relative w-[100%] max-w-[588px] "><div><label><p class="text-marine01 my-1 font-bold text-[14px] text-black"> Enter your email address</p><input class="h-7 w-full rounded-full border-2 p-3 focus:outline-0 w-[100%] py-1.5 px-3 pr-[48px] border-blue07 focus:border-blue05 hover:border-blue05 " placeholder=" Enter your email address" type="email" name="" value=""/></label></div><button class="button_btn-primary-orange__2JVn7 text-left undefined absolute bottom-[0] right-[0] h-[48px] !px-3" tabindex="0"><span class="text-marine01 header6">Subscribe</span></button></div></div></main><!--$--><style>
#nprogress {
  pointer-events: none;
}

#nprogress .bar {
  background: #2363B8;

  position: fixed;
  z-index: 99999;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;

  width: 100%;
  height: 4px;
}

/* Fancy blur effect */
#nprogress .peg {
  display: block;
  position: absolute;
  right: 0px;
  width: 100px;
  height: 100%;
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px #2363B8, 0 0 5px #2363B8;
  opacity: 1.0;

  -webkit-transform: rotate(3deg) translate(0px, -4px);
      -ms-transform: rotate(3deg) translate(0px, -4px);
          transform: rotate(3deg) translate(0px, -4px);
}

/* Remove these to get rid of the spinner */
#nprogress .spinner {
  display: block;
  position: fixed;
  z-index: 1031;
  top: 15px;
  bottom: auto;
  right: 15px;
  left: auto;
}

#nprogress .spinner-icon {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  box-sizing: border-box;

  border: solid 2px transparent;
  border-top-color: #2363B8;
  border-left-color: #2363B8;
  border-radius: 50%;

  -webkit-animation: nprogress-spinner 400ms linear infinite;
          animation: nprogress-spinner 400ms linear infinite;
}

.nprogress-custom-parent {
  overflow: hidden;
  position: relative;
}

.nprogress-custom-parent #nprogress .spinner,
.nprogress-custom-parent #nprogress .bar {
  position: absolute;
}

@-webkit-keyframes nprogress-spinner {
  0%   { -webkit-transform: rotate(0deg); }
  100% { -webkit-transform: rotate(360deg); }
}
@keyframes nprogress-spinner {
  0%   { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}
